WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:02.420
I want to get some clothes.

2
00:00:02.421 --> 00:00:08.047
I open the closet.

3
00:00:08.048 --> 00:00:10.081
I want to go shopping.

4
00:00:10.082 --> 00:00:17.547
I go into the department store.

5
00:00:17.548 --> 00:00:20.257
I want to go to the sixth floor.

6
00:00:20.258 --> 00:00:27.025
I take the elevator.

7
00:00:27.026 --> 00:00:28.793
I want to go home.

8
00:00:28.794 --> 00:00:35.003
I take the bus.

9
00:00:35.004 --> 00:00:37.286
I want to bake some cookies.

10
00:00:37.287 --> 00:00:42.819
I open the oven.

11
00:00:42.820 --> 00:00:45.038
I want to do the laundry.

12
00:00:45.039 --> 00:00:51.730
I open the washing machine.

13
00:00:51.731 --> 00:00:54.447
My parents want to park the car.

14
00:00:54.448 --> 00:01:02.770
They drive into the garage.

15
00:01:02.771 --> 00:01:06.120
I want to go outside.

16
00:01:06.121 --> 00:01:11.222
Where's the cat?

